MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Recording view rebuilt as a full-page notepad workspace (the AI-notepad
  pattern Hyprnote/Granola proved): editable lecture title + ON AIR + timer in
  the header; left pane = live-preview NoteEditor for typing while it listens;
  right sidecar = compact waveform, live transcript, drugs-just-mentioned chips,
  consent pill
- Saved note now merges the student's typed notes ('My notes') with the
  on-device transcript ('Transcript') under one title
- 'Enhance with Nemesis' after stop: prefills the agent with instructions to
  rewrite the saved Library note in place (merge sections, fix garbles against
  pharm vocabulary, structure, append 5 flashcard candidates) via its file tools
- Idle view unchanged (start card + saved recordings)
